    {
      "id": "claim_ffb32ced5251461b9c7b7f251c8b8a8d",
      "statement": "The MCP server serves streamable-http on port 8766 (--stdio for trusted local clients). Without DIGI_MCP_REQUIRE_AUTH it is unauthenticated; with that flag, every tool verifies a digikey-issued RS256 bearer token (signature via DIGIKEY_JWKS_URL / DIGIKEY_PUBLIC_KEY_PEM, plus issuer/audience/exp), applies the same fail-closed blocklist revocation policy as DigiAuthMiddleware, enforces per-tool scopes (digigraph:workflow, digigraph:chat, digigraph:mcp), and refuses every call when auth is required but no verifier is configured (stdio also fails closed).",
