    {
      "id": "claim_07ddd3a313c042deb105ef873cbb70ce",
      "statement": "The MCP server exposes five tools: workflow (scope digigraph:workflow), chat (digigraph:chat, calls FastAPI /v1/chat/completions in-process via TestClient), thread_state (digigraph:mcp, calls FastAPI /threads/{id}/state in-process), list_orchestrator_tools, and list_orchestrator_tools_detailed. The in-process calls forward the verified caller bearer via Authorization header so DigiAuthMiddleware re-verifies it. create_mcp_server() sets DIGI_ENABLE_THREAD_API=1 in the process.",
